# The top circle of loft_guide_profiles.tlspr lofted to the bottom one,
# picked with the mouse, and held to the guide sketch's cubic by New
# Group > Guide Loft by Selected Curves; the same as path_loft_guides.go
# makes (TestPathEquivalence/loft_guides, roadmap 28.3).
file $testdata/ui/loft_guide_profiles.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view iso
click-entity 40000
menu Features|Loft To Selected Profile
click-entity 50000
menu Features|Guide Loft by Selected Curves
